message: "If you use PyEvoc in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software

title: "PyEvoc: Computational Hierarchical Evocation Analysis for Digital Corpora"
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-06-04"

authors:
  - family-names: "Misuraca"
    given-names: "Michelangelo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8794-966X"

abstract: >
  PyEvoc is a research-oriented Python framework for adapting the Hierarchical
  Evocation Method (HEM) to large-scale digital textual corpora. It extends
  classical Social Representation Theory approaches by combining lexical
  diffusion, positional salience, rhetorical foregrounding, and temporal
  dynamics to reconstruct representational structures from naturally occurring
  online discourse.

